  "document": "Cand.med.vet.\nCand.med.vet (Candidatus/candidata (male/female) medicinae veterinariae) or \"candidate of veterinary medicine\" is an academic degree awarded in Scandinavian countries following a 5,5 to 6 year veterinary medical school education. It is equivalent with the same kind of degrees given in other countries, like: DVM, VDM, BVSc, BVM&S etc., which also opens for authorization as a veterinarian."
